    "body": "Thanks @spikeypineapple. A sample would help a lot. If you can attach a short DNM program (or the relevant snippets) showing:\n- **TSC:** the coolant-through M code. Your control's M-code list matters, since builders differ.\n- **Rotary:** the clamp and unclamp M codes around an index move.\n- **Probing:** a probing call, either Inspection Plus or Doosan's macro.\n- **Chip conveyor:** the chip conveyor and auger M codes.\n- **Smoothing:** the `G5.1` line your control accepts, with its R range.\n\nThat gives us the dialect to post exactly what your machine expects, instead of guessing. The smoothing side is being designed on #616, and this post would reuse it. Please remove anything proprietary from the program.",
